     1717     apply "choose" to Btn_desmark in frame Dialog-Frame.
     1718     run refresh-view.
     1719   END.
     1720   ON leave OF f_date IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1721   do:
     1722     run refresh-view.
     1723   end.
     1724   ON return OF f_date IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1725   do:
